# Attribution

This project does not use Cursor commit or PR attribution.

When creating commits or pull requests:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or similar co-author trailers
- Do not add "Made with Cursor" footers or badges to commit messages or PR descriptions
- Do not enable or suggest Cursor attribution settings for this repo

If attribution is controlled by a tool or setting, leave it disabled for work in this repository.
